      "doc": "Studio :8888 is a view-layer upstream, not a hub backend: owner yamls inject STUDIO_MCP_AUTH (raw sk-... API key in studio-mcp.token, source unsloth.env). Since Studio 2026.10.7 the server ignores UNSLOTH_STUDIO_MCP_TOKEN; agents need an sk-... key.",
